# Read by rg, ugrep and fd (not git): build output under puzzles/ that no
# search wants. The puzzles themselves stay searchable at
# puzzles/<series>/<year>/<id>.json.
#
# .gitignore already lists these files, but it ignores puzzles/<id>/index.html
# file by file, so rg still opens all ~66k puzzles/<id>/ directories to find
# out each holds nothing else. Ignoring the directories skips that walk. A
# series folder never starts with a digit or has a -<digit> in its name, so
# these two patterns only match per-puzzle page folders.

# One crawlable page per puzzle (tools/build_seo_pages.py): puzzles/<id>/index.html
/puzzles/*-[0-9]*/
/puzzles/[0-9]*/
/puzzles/*/index.html
/puzzles/index.html
/puzzles/series/

# The per-puzzle script shims and their gzipped forms (fetch_puzzle.py --reindex,
# tools/stage_site.py).
/puzzles/*.js
/puzzles/*.js.gz
